>> Animal := Mea fou.
Animal pe-a-oo-mai: ['sound:'] fai: { :s lana-lava sound := s. }.
Animal pe-a-oo-mai: ['makeSound'] fai: { Tuuina-atu tusi: lana-lava sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal fou.
Cat pe-a-oo-mai: ['init'] fai: { lana-lava sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat pe-a-oo-mai: ['meow'] fai: { ia-lava makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
